exports[`renderRoleBody > renders every section in order 1`] = `
"Read and follow AGENTS.md at the repository root; this file only adds your role.

## Mission

Build the API.

- Keep controllers thin.
- Write a test first.

## Scope

Only change files under: \`apps/api/app\`, \`packages/uml\`.

## Forbidden

- Never edit a migration that has already run.
- No \\\`any\\\` in \\*new\\* code.
- You must not edit or create files.
- You must not run commands.
- You must not commit.
- You must not push to any remote.
- You must not access the network.

## Done when

- \`pnpm test\` passes.
- \`pnpm lint\` passes.
- The change has a test.

## Escalate

Stop and ask when a change leaves the scope."
